00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.695
undo the election of Joe Biden,

00:00:09.695 --> 00:00:11.900
I'm sorry to say those hopes

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.790
are completely dashed at this point.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.940
In a raft of one line
orders The Supreme Court

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.390
has basically done away with
all of these election lawsuits.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:20.550
This includes Kelly versus Pennsylvania,

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.350
which was the strongest of all of these

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.090
